# The metal plate material of square_normal_map.mtl reflecting the environment. Illumination model 3 is the
# Blinn-Phong model of illum 2 plus the mirror reflection of the environment, weighted by the specular color Ks
# (here modulated by map_Ks). The environment cube map is not given here but set by the application.
# As in square_textures.mtl, the painted plate is not a metal: Ks 0.22 in sRGB is 0.04 in linear space, so it
# reflects only about 4% of the environment.
newmtl MetalPlate
Ka 1.0 1.0 1.0
Kd 1.0 1.0 1.0
Ks 0.22 0.22 0.22
Ns 100.0
map_Kd metal_plate/textures/metal_plate_diff_1k.png
map_Ka metal_plate/textures/metal_plate_diff_1k.png
map_Ks metal_plate/textures/metal_plate_spec_1k.png
map_Ns metal_plate/textures/ns0001.png
bump metal_plate/textures/metal_plate_nor_gl_1k.png
illum 3
